msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Methods of repository interfaces that follow the Spring Data conventions can "
"be automatically implemented (unless they fall into one of the unsupported "
"cases listed later on).\n"
"This means that methods like the following will all work:"
msgstr ""

msgid "User defined queries"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"User supplied queries contained in the `@Query` annotation. For example "
"things like the following all work:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"All methods that are annotated with `@Modifying` will automatically be "
"annotated with `@Transactional`."
msgstr ""

